---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
description: Delivering accurate, credible, and unbiased aviation and aerospace content.
permalink: index.html
---
<section class="hero" style="padding:0;">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">ON THE FLIGHTLINE NOW</div>
    <h1>Aviation, told by the people who live it.</h1>
    <p>Delivering accurate, credible, and unbiased aviation and aerospace content — from critical safety findings to the individuals who keep aircraft moving and communities connected.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="/stories.html" class="btn btn-solid">Start Reading</a>
      <a href="/about.html" class="btn btn-outline">About Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="strip">
    <span class="strip-label">FLT REVIEW</span>
    <span class="strip-fill"></span>
    <span>EST. 2026</span>
    <span class="strip-fill"></span>
    <span>INDEPENDENT · UNBIASED</span>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="wrap">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Featured Stories</h2>
    <div class="section-note">Reporting from the flightline — safety findings, profiles, and the people behind the operation.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="story-list">
    {% for article in collections.articles | reverse %}
      {% if loop.index0 < 3 %}
      <a href="{{ article.url }}" class="story-row">
        <span class="story-date">{{ article.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
        <div>
          <div class="story-title">{{ article.data.title }}</div>
          <div class="story-dek">{{ article.data.dek }}</div>
        </div>
        <span class="story-tag">{{ article.data.tag }}</span>
      </a>
      {% endif %}
    {% else %}
      <p style="color:var(--slate); padding:24px 0;">No stories published yet — check back soon.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap" style="padding-top:0; padding-bottom:112px;">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Featured Photos</h2>
    <div class="section-note">A few of our favorite captures — moments that didn't need words.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="photo-grid">
    <div class="ph"><img src="/images/row-of-planes.jpeg" alt="Row of general aviation aircraft on the ramp"></div>
    <div class="ph"><img src="/images/remove-before-flight.jpeg" alt="Remove Before Flight tag on an aircraft wing"></div>
    <div class="ph"><img src="/images/southwest.jpeg" alt="Southwest Airlines jet on approach at dusk"></div>
    <div class="ph"><img src="/images/piper-sunset.jpeg" alt="Piper aircraft parked under a sunset sky"></div>
    <div class="ph"><img src="/images/wingtip.jpeg" alt="Aircraft wingtip view over a city at night"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background:var(--steel); padding-top:72px; padding-bottom:72px;">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="split-photo">masthead crew · 2026</div>
    <div class="split-text">
      <h2>Aviation is more than regulations and investigations.</h2>
      <p>It's people, passion, and purpose. We tell the stories that shape the skies with honesty, independence, and heart — from the flightline up.</p>
      <a href="/about.html" class="btn" style="border-color:var(--ink); color:var(--ink); display:inline-block;">Read Our Story</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Our Values</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="values-list">
    <div class="value-item">
      <span class="value-num">01</span>
      <h3>Integrity</h3>
      <p>We do what's right, no matter who's watching.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-item">
      <span class="value-num">02</span>
      <h3>Excellence</h3>
      <p>We show up and give our best to every reader, every time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-item">
      <span class="value-num">03</span>
      <h3>Objectivity</h3>
      <p>We report honestly, without judgment, and without bias.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-item">
      <span class="value-num">04</span>
      <h3>Respect</h3>
      <p>We treat every source and reader with dignity.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
